=\"10\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/check-blue.svg\"/></div><span class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkText\">100% client satisfaction Score</span></li><li class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkItem\"><div class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkIcon\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/check-blue.svg\"/></div><span class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkText\">Seamless Logistics &amp; Coordination</span></li><li class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkItem\"><div class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkIcon\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/check-blue.svg\"/></div><span class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkText\">Delivered Under Budget</span></li><li class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkItem\"><div class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkIcon\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/check-blue.svg\"/></div><span class=\"EventsFeatured-module-scss-module__rxX6dW__checkText\">Proximity to venues</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"EventsSuccessStories-module-scss-module__pThZoG__section\"><div class=\"EventsSuccessStories-module-scss-module__pThZoG__topBadge\"><span>97% Satisfaction Rate</span></div><div class=\"EventsSuccessStories-module-scss-module__pThZoG__header\"><h2 class=\"EventsSuccessStories-module-scss-module__pThZoG__title\">Past Event Success Stories</h2><p class=\"EventsSuccessStories-module-scss-module__pThZoG__subtitle\">Proven track record with international organizations</p></div><div class=\"ReviewGrid-module-scss-module__FsDWRq_